asy, \"traits\": [dodatkowe cechy], \"attrs\": {...}, \"id\": opcjonalnie}"},"has_default":false,"edit":"json"},{"name":"action","type":"string","required":true,"description":{"en":"Action id from the catalogue","pl":"Identyfikator akcji z katalogu"},"has_default":false,"edit":"choice:actions"},{"name":"scope","type":"string","required":false,"description":{"en":"Scope level of the scopes chain, or an object {level: instance id}; default: the most specific level","pl":"Poziom łańcucha zakresów albo obiekt {poziom: id}; domyślnie najbardziej szczegółowy"},"has_default":false,"edit":"free_text"}],"http":{"verb":"POST","path":"/api/actions/explain"},"result_text":{"en":"Why {{action}} fits the element or does not:","pl":"Dlaczego {{action}} pasuje do elementu albo nie pasuje:"}},"actions.propose_chain":{"id":"actions.propose_chain","kind":"atomic","status":"implemented","title":"Propose a chain of actions","description":"Candidate chains of actions that make a missing trait (or the requirements of a target action) available, ranked by declared cost and confidence and bounded by the extrapolation preset. Proposals only: nothing is executed. The preset and every threshold resolve through the same scope chain as the rules (installation preset, the user's settings extrapolation_preset / extrapolation_bounds, rules with effect set_value on a conversation or a project); the answer carries `resolved` (which scope, rule and initiator set each value) and `scope`.","labels":{"pl":"Zaproponuj łańcuch akcji"},"inputs":["json"],"outputs":["json"],"requires":["application"],"produces":[],"content_op":"none","form_op":"none","cost":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"effects":{"reads_only":true,"writes":false,"sends_off_device":false,"costs_money":false,"irreversible":false,"touches_private_data":false},"consumer":"loom/src/actions/action_rules.cpp","port":"actions","action":"propose_chain","params":[{"name":"element","type":"object","required":true,"description":{"en":"The element: {\"class\": class id, \"tra)LPROFILE",
