  R"LPROFILE(mergent":{"type":"object","description":"The catalogue grows from conversations (R55), always as proposals and never silently. `setting`/`active`/`presets`: off | propose. command_shape: an input that matches no action but has the shape of a command (a verb-like lead word, an element, no question) is offered as the definition of a new action (a composite with one use_model step whose prompt is the user's own instruction; requires inferred from the element's traits among requires_from; the phrase joins the lexicon). sequences: the same chain of actions, each run on the result of the one before, on elements of one class `repeat` times in a row (consecutive within gap_seconds, at most max_length long; the last window_runs occurrences of a chain are counted for each class, kept in an incremental index) is offered as one composite. groups: a user-defined action used on min_classes classes that share traits is offered a group (named trait bundle) of what they share. Accepting writes only user overlays; every proposal leaves a node of `node.kind` with links `node.link` to the messages it emerged from.","required":["setting","active","presets","command_shape","naming","requires_from","definition","sequences","groups","node"],"properties":{"setting":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"active":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"presets":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"type":"object"}},"command_shape":{"type":"object","required":["max_tokens","min_lead_chars","element_within","lead_skip","not_leads","forbid_question_mark","verbs","statement"],"properties":{"max_tokens":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"min_lead_chars":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"element_within":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"lead_skip":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"not_leads":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"forbid_question_mark":{"type":"boolean"},"verbs":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"description":"P17: the lea